{
  "_doc": "Vibe chips, shared by the home page (chip pools) and scripts/library/harvest_vibes.py (which searches YouTube playlists for each vibe every month). general = English songs; hindi / punjabi = that language's own vibes; anyLanguage = general vibes that are also harvested in Hindi and Punjabi, so they still play when only those languages are picked. search = playlist searches for a vibe whose label is a poor search phrase (default: '<label> songs playlist' plus a language qualifier). A search key '<label>|hi' (or '|pa') is the phrasing for that vibe in that language - an English label searched in Hindi finds other people's 'Chill' playlists. curated = vibes whose playlists are one channel's uploads by nature (lofi, ambient, royalty-free): a channel dominating a playlist is allowed there and the exact upload is downloaded. profiles = per vibe, the moods its songs usually have (want), moods that contradict it (avoid: a song carrying one almost never plays in that vibe), its energy band on the library's 0..1 intensity percentile, and instrumental: true when it wants no singing. Written by scripts/library/judge_vibes.mjs profiles; hand edits are kept (it only fills vibes without one unless --again).",
